WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.210
Are you all right, Mr. Borough?

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.540
Mr. Borough! Mr. Borough, hurry!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.460
Mr. Borough!

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.380
Get Proto One...!

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.420
Get out of there first! It's about to explode!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.710
Proto One, wait!

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.830
This is dangerous! We have to get out of here!

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.540
What?

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.960
The oxygen?! Dammit!

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:57.170
Complications

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:01.170
Where's Chirico? Where'd he go?

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:04.420
Dunno. Isn't he still in the water?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.170
Fall back! All units, fall back!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.630
Prepare to receive incoming helicopter! Hurry!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.670
I want Ypsilon contacted at once.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:38.670
Yes, sir!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.380
Government forces spotted at point P-15,

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:45.040
forty kilometers downriver of
Prince Kanjelman's palace.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.630
You were most valiant.
forty kilometers downriver of
Prince Kanjelman's palace.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.290
It was nothing, sir.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.500
This is number six!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.040
Try to raise Ypsilon.
Mr. Borough needs to reach him.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.250
Ypsilon isn't here.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.170
He's not?

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.130
This is Borough. Where is he?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.880
He's gone after Proto One.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.130
Communications with him are still out.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.500
During the confusion in command,
the enemy got away.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.210
That damned fool!

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:08.250
So, your epoch-making weapon
is merely a creature of emotions.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.170
Now that this has happened,
I must ask for a favor.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:13.380
To capture her?

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.630
I'm afraid-

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:16.040
I want her killed.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:21.000
You insult me, sir!
I am not a murderer of women!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.210
She's a weapon, not a woman.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.210
A dangerous weapon
who's betrayed us for Chirico.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.670
You brought that monster here!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:33.250
What are you saying?
We did it for you, Majesty.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.460
For the sake of
the Holy Kingdom of Kummen-

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.040
I grow tired of your words!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:41.210
You only used Kummen's civil war
for your weapon's development.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.630
You admitted your goals already!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.500
But I allowed it, despite that!
Do you understand?

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.380
Your Highness...

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:54.290
I can guarantee your freedom and safety
only as long as your work benefits us!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.380
Any instructions to the unit, sir?

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:01.960
This is the last favor I'll ever grant to you.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.960
Track down Proto One and kill her.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.290
Yes, Highness. But...

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.250
But what?!

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.630
If Ypsilon loses control-

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.210
That won't happen! I swear to you.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.750
Persistent, aren't they?

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.710
Looks like they've finally given up.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.830
We'll move out in five minutes.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.460
Until then, we rest.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.130
I'm moving out.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.960
We were all saved by the girl in that helicopter.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.790
She's on our side now.
We should try to find her.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.830
And what about our mission, you damned fool?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.790
Secure that talk until we have the PS.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.170
The PS is where the girl is.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.630
Why, you...! You're disobeying orders!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.130
Stop him!

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.960
I said stop him!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.290
What's the matter with you? Get going!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.710
Shako, shoot him!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.380
God dammit...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.580
Are you disobeying me? I'm your superior!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.000
Yeah, yeah. Of course you are.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.750
But don't you think we should do
what Chirico says this time?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.750
Your orders, Captain?

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.540
All right! This once.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.880
Just this once!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.670
Aye, aye, sir!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:05.830
I've finally found you.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.210
Let me go!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.040
Why are you running?

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.750
Because of him? Is Chirico really that...

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.170
Stay away from me!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.830
I don't think you'll shoot me.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.290
You're right. I can't shoot you.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:31.460
Stop it!

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:34.080
Drop the gun!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.210
What are you doing?

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.170
We've been ordered to kill Proto One.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.790
He's going to fight us.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.790
Don't worry! Open fire!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.040
But, sir!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.330
Just do it! Kill Proto One!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.290
Yes, sir! All units, open fire!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.290
Just like you said, sir. Ypsilon isn't shooting.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.040
Target Proto One only!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:24.580
Yes, sir!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:25.830
Why won't he fire?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.920
Subconscious conditioning.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:31.170
He can't open fire on allied forces.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.710
Proto One, don't go!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.540
They're close.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.830
Now to pay her back for before. Right, Potaria?

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:58.960
Right.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.920
Your orders, Captain?

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.330
Not yet... We can't-

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.170
We'll cut through the jungle and deploy.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.330
Wait! All of you!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:19.250
All right! But remember,
we're after the PS, got that?

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.500
No, we're going to save the girl.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.210
Once we have her,
the PS is sure to come after us.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.420
We're on it, Captain!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.790
Let's go, Captain... sir.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:35.830
Come on!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:37.960
All right! Forward!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:46.880
Get out of the way! I don't want to hurt you!

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:47.830
Stay back!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.670
Chirico!

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.330
Cover me!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.290
Chirico?!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.790
Are you all right?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.290
Now we end it, Chirico!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:54.000
Even a PS can't beat me in your condition.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.670
No time for discussions.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.170
Just get out of here!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.670
Chirico!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.630
What?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.790
Something's wrong. I don't see Kan Yu here!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:05.880
What?

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.880
Who are you? You're no normal person.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.250
I see. You're the PS, aren't you?

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.330
The enemy task force interfered.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.960
Proto One managed to escape.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.170
And Ypsilon?

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:07.420
Injured, but we have him.

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:08.630
Bring him back!

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:09.630
Yes, sir!

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:13.130
Forgive this failure, Your Majesty.

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:15.250
I won't use my troops for this again.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:19.630
It'll be the rainy season soon.
We need this opportunity to win!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.670
Not yet? Hurry!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.750
Stand by, sir. We're connecting you.

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.670
This is Gon Nu.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.750
General! This is Kan Yu!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.380
Where are you?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:20.170
In a ravine five klicks west
of Crescent Moon Lake.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.460
It's a success!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.460
What?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.500
I've captured the PS!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.170
You did?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.790
The girl, not the other one.

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.750
Excellent! You were able to capture it alive?

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:31.460
Yes, but we're pinned down.
Enemies all around. Can't move.

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.130
What about Chirico?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.460
He went off somewhere on his own.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:41.250
I just had to get the PS by myself!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.460
I need reinforcements to be sent ASAP!

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.790
Understood. Stay there.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.210
Give us your location.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:52.670
Right. North of point P, five thousand...

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.330
by west, seventy-two hundred.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:58.420
Yes, sir.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:14:59.790
Yes, sir.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.790
Reinforcements will be here in an hour.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.460
They'll treat you better than I'm going to.

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:15.710
But before we start, I want to ask you something.

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:18.960
What exactly is Chirico to you?

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.630
Run!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.460
Hurry!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.920
Now you die!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.710
Help me!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.130
Help!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.210
We found his AT in the target area.

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:01.460
But we can't find Captain Kan Yu, sir.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.170
Keep looking for him!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.170
Yes, sir!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:30.960
Chirico...

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:39.460
It probably hurts a lot, but it's not that serious.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.250
Where are we?

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.670
About five klicks upriver.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.040
You carried me here by yourself?

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.380
Oh, I see.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:54.920
The Kummen forces?

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.790
Searching hard, but they can't find us.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.170
Don't!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.420
I'm fine.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:02.670
No, you're not.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:04.330
You're still very weak.

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.710
You haven't had any sleep, have you?

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.540
Not for two days... I think.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.880
I got some ammo and rations from that other AT.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.670
We can make them last for three days.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.830
So please, just relax.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:34.170
This is Brown Hornet. This is Brown Hornet.

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.420
No sign of Captain Kan Yu's team.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.880
We'll expand the search
another ten square kilometers, over.

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:42.460
Roger!

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:27.750
Chirico!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.830
Are you all right?

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:31.920
Yeah.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.790
Are you sure? Don't push yourself.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.380
Careful!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.540
It's still too soon.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:50.500
I'm... hungry.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.580
So am I.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.790
Is it really that funny?

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:31.170
How was it?

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.170
It's strange. It tastes totally different.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:40.170
It's regular army meat rations, just cooked a little.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.580
Was that also part of your programming?

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.790
Don't worry about it.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.380
Maybe you were raised as a PS, but now...

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.710
But now I look like a normal human?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:58.330
It's not like I only know
what they programmed me with.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.920
There're a lot of things
I learned on my own after that.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.130
I see.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.210
I'll clean up.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.250
By the way, how do I get to Kanjelman's palace?

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.290
It's that way?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.830
About thirty klicks.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.250
Just follow the river.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.460
Forget about it, Chirico.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:52.130
Run away with me!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:56.580
Didn't I ask you to do that with me
three months ago?

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:06.710
Why go there? You can't beat them by yourself.

00:22:09.580 --> 00:22:11.750
Why? What is it?

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:13.830
Don't I matter at all to you?

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.670
I think you know why.

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:33.330
I'd finally found Fyana again.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:35.380
But then why do I still need to fight?

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:39.500
Is there any point to my trying to stop
Borough and his group?

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:59.540
Unless the storm blows, the sun cannot shine.

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:02.210
A wild wind must first sweep across the land.

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.540
If you are to reach safety at the end of the battle,

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:08.170
then you must trust in
the boiling of your own blood.

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:13.540
Then the men who shoulder the burden of
destiny can raise their faces in triumph.

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:15.920
Next time, "Intersection"

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:18.880
When the arrow flies free, will it strike the target?

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.580
Or will it only fall to the earth?

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Intersection

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
